<p>The cover examples show the model reimagining an existing song in a completely different genre, and the <a href="https://map-yue2.github.io/#agentic-music-editing">agentic editing demo</a> walks through 9 planning steps and 14 rendered versions of a single song.</p>
<h2 id="running-it">Running it</h2>
<p>YuE2-3B runs locally on a <strong>24 GB NVIDIA GPU</strong> (Linux, Python 3.10+) without quantization. The team distributes an inference wheel alongside the 7.3 GB checkpoint on Hugging Face:</p>
